  "title": "Magdalena M NDE 5294",
  "date": "26 de Enero de 2005",
  "content": "As I started to walk, I told them I was feeling awful. Even though a doctor, a nurse and some relatives were helping me walk, I started to feel worse and I told them again. Then I just lost my strength. All of a sudden, I felt a painful pressure in my chest. Something very strong threw me backwards at great speed into a very dark tunnel. I felt very frightened but suddenly I was floating forwards inside the tunnel. I started to feel much better. I could make out a golden light at the end of the tunnel, like a beautiful sunset. I felt flighty, light and very happy, more peaceful than I ever had in my life. As I was approaching the light, I could see something like several silhouettes waiting for me. It was all peace and happiness, but suddenly I could not go forward any more. I felt like something was stopping me and then something was grabbing my hand. I thought of my baby and of my other two daughters. I returned as fast as I had left. I could see everybody helping in some way, injections and other things, and my husband was holding my hand really strongly and begging, 'Don't go, don't go!' I know that was what stopped me from going. I am happy about it, but I think death cannot be that bad if it is anything like what I experienced.",
